{"text":"For the audition, I worked on one monologue that I'd picked up in a speech class when I was 12, and on another from Shakespeare's Juliet, whom I had played when I was 14. Mind you, I'm 25 at this point. I had no other choices, and so I made do. As I boarded the plane to the U.S., there were naysayers in my head telling me I was crazy that I shouldn't even bother. Over 900 people auditioned for 15 spots each year, and yet there was a part of me that knew I could do it, even when the part of me that said it was impossible was louder. Our dreams arise from our imaginations. They belong to us. We owe it to ourselves to try and realize them. To encourage myself, I wrote in my diary on the 23rd of August, 2008. I have this dream and desire to be an actor, and it dwarfs me. But it is my dream, God damn it. I made it up. How can what I dream up defeat me?","words":[{"text":"For","start":0.0,"end":0.54},{"text":"the","start":0.54,"end":0.74},{"text":"audition","start":0.74,"end":1.28,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":1.98,"end":2.42},{"text":"worked","start":2.42,"end":2.66},{"text":"on","start":2.66,"end":3.12},{"text":"one","start":3.12,"end":3.36},{"text":"monologue","start":3.36,"end":3.84},{"text":"that","start":3.84,"end":4.16},{"text":"I'd","start":4.16,"end":4.4},{"text":"picked","start":4.4,"end":4.58},{"text":"up","start":4.58,"end":4.84},{"text":"in","start":4.84,"end":5.14},{"text":"a","start":5.14,"end":5.28},{"text":"speech","start":5.28,"end":5.58},{"text":"class","start":5.58,"end":5.94},{"text":"when","start":5.94,"end":6.18},{"text":"I","start":6.18,"end":6.34},{"text":"was","start":6.34,"end":6.54},{"text":"12","start":6.54,"end":6.84,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":7.58,"end":8.06},{"text":"on","start":8.06,"end":8.54},{"text":"another","start":8.54,"end":8.92},{"text":"from","start":8.92,"end":9.2},{"text":"Shakespeare's","start":9.2,"end":9.9},{"text":"Juliet","start":9.9,"end":10.18,"punct":","},{"text":"whom","start":10.4,"end":10.5},{"text